WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:16.470
Tom walked along the path in the Dark Forest.

2
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.500
The forest was spooky.

3
00:00:26.927 --> 00:01:04.817
"Where is the palace?" thought Tom.

4
00:01:04.818 --> 00:01:10.639
Tom saw a peddler.

5
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.230
"Do you know where the palace is?" asked Tom.

6
00:01:15.738 --> 00:01:19.028
"Yes," said the peddler.

7
00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:22.630
"It's where it always is, you fool!"

8
00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:31.700
"What a rude man," thought Tom.

9
00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:37.036
Tom walked some more.

10
00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:40.040
But he still did not see the palace.

11
00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:43.520
He pulled out the map.

12
00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:48.310
Suddenly a cold wind blew.

13
00:01:49.398 --> 00:01:52.870
"Brr!" Tom shivered.

14
00:01:52.871 --> 00:01:55.869
He reached into his sack.

15
00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:57.980
He found his mittens.

16
00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.450
But where was his fur hat?

17
00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:13.030
"I will make a new hat appear!" said Tom.

18
00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:16.360
He pointed his wand at his head.

19
00:02:16.477 --> 00:02:19.364
"Fur hat!" he said.

20
00:02:19.365 --> 00:02:35.232
Poof! Poof! Poof!

21
00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:39.410
Now something warm and furry sat on his head!

22
00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:43.030
"I did it!" Tom said proudly.

23
00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.970
Just then the cold wind blew again.

24
00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.970
The map flew out of Tom's hands!

25
00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.550
The map flew off the path and through the trees.

26
00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.570
Tom gulped.

27
00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:03.510
"Master said to stay on the path," thought Tom.

28
00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:06.070
"But I need that map!"

29
00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.670
Nervously Tom stepped off the path.

30
00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.400
He went deeper and deeper into the forest.

31
00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:24.970
Suddenly Tom stopped.

32
00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:28.650
"Huh?" he said.

33
00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:30.750
He felt his head.

34
00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.610
His fur hat was moving!
